+    "When using \"This Server\", if a record does not exists in the zone then the request is forwarded to the DNS Server's resolver internally. This allows you to override any record for the forwarded domain name or control its DNSSEC validation.": "使用“此服务器”时，如果区域中不存在记录，则请求将在内部转发到 DNS 服务器的解析器。这允许您覆盖转发域名的任何记录或控制其 DNSSEC 验证。",
+    "feature to improve resiliency by using expired or stale records in cache to respond when the DNS Server is unable to reach the upstream or authoritative name servers to refresh the expired records before the Max Wait Time configured below.": "当 DNS 服务器无法在下面配置的最大等待时间之前到达上游或权威名称服务器以刷新过期记录时，该功能可使用缓存中的过期或陈旧记录进行响应，从而提高弹性。",
+    "The restore process will overwrite existing config files on disk for above selected items and reload new settings including user accounts from the backup. The current logged in user account and current session will be added automatically.": "恢复过程将覆盖磁盘上上述选定项目的现有配置文件，并重新加载新设置，包括备份中的用户帐户。当前登录的用户帐户和当前会话将自动添加。",
