+    "The process to promote to Primary node may take a while to complete depending on the size of the complete configuration being resynced and the number of local zones that need to be converted. Please be patient till the process completes.": "升级为主节点的过程可能需要一段时间才能完成，具体取决于重新同步的完整配置的大小以及需要转换的本地区域的数量。请耐心等待该过程完成。",
+    "The initialization of a new Cluster will make the current DNS Server its Primary node. You can add other DNS Servers to this Cluster later which will get added as Secondary nodes. No data will be lost on this DNS Server in this process.": "新集群的初始化将使当前的 DNS 服务器成为主节点。您可以稍后将其他 DNS 服务器添加到此集群，这些服务器将被添加为辅助节点。在此过程中，该 DNS 服务器上的数据不会丢失。",
+    "Forwarders are upstream DNS servers which this DNS Server must use to resolve domain names. If no forwarders are configured then the DNS Server will use preconfigured ROOT HINTS to perform recursive resolution to resolve domain names.": "转发器是上游 DNS 服务器，此 DNS 服务器必须使用它来解析域名。如果没有配置转发器，则 DNS 服务器将使用预先配置的 ROOT HINTS 执行递归解析来解析域名。",
