+    "below to allow requests coming from your reverse proxy server. Enabling this option also allows automatic TLS certificate renewal with HTTP challenge (webroot) for DNS-over-HTTPS service when DNS-over-HTTP port is set to 80.": "下面允许来自您的反向代理服务器的请求。当 DNS-over-HTTP 端口设置为 80 时，启用此选项还允许通过 HTTP 质询 (webroot) 自动续订 DNS-over-HTTPS 服务的 TLS 证书。",
