+    "Map Remote Groups (CN) at directory service to Local Groups for both new and existing users signed up via LDAP. A LDAP user's group membership will be automatically synced to the mapped Local Groups each time they log in.": "对于通过 LDAP 注册的新用户和现有用户，将目录服务中的远程组 (CN) 映射到本地组。 LDAP 用户的组成员身份将在每次登录时自动同步到映射的本地组。",
+    "The DNS Server HTTP API allows any 3rd party app or script to configure the DNS Server. The HTTP API is used by this web console and thus all the actions that this web console does can be performed via the API. Read the": "DNS 服务器 HTTP API 允许任何第 3 方应用程序或脚本配置 DNS 服务器。此 Web 控制台使用 HTTP API，因此此 Web 控制台执行的所有操作都可以通过 API 执行。阅读",
+    "Forwarders are sorted by priority value i.e. forwarder with low priority value will be queried before trying for forwarder with high priority value. Forwarders with the same priority value will be queried concurrently.": "转发器按优先级值排序，即在尝试具有高优先级值的转发器之前将查询具有低优先级值的转发器。具有相同优先级值的转发器将被同时查询。",
+    "The Remove Node process will ask the selected Secondary node to leave the Cluster gracefully. The Secondary will then initiate Leave Cluster process as if the Leave Cluster action was performed on that node itself.": "删除节点过程将要求选定的辅助节点优雅地离开集群。然后，辅助节点将启动离开集群过程，就像在该节点本身上执行离开集群操作一样。",
+    "When enabled, the secondary zone will be validated using the ZONEMD record after every zone transfer. The zone will get disabled if the validation fails. The zone must be DNSSEC signed for the validation to work.": "启用后，将在每次区域传输后使用 ZONEMD 记录验证辅助区域。如果验证失败，该区域将被禁用。该区域必须经过 DNSSEC 签名才能进行验证。",
