+    "option for more details on adding DS record. If this is a private zone, then you should manually activate the KSK so that the DNS Server stops the detection process which queries for DS records periodically.": "有关添加 DS 记录的更多详细信息的选项。如果这是私有区域，则您应该手动激活 KSK，以便 DNS 服务器停止定期查询 DS 记录的检测过程。",
+    "The process to join the Cluster may take a while to complete depending on the amount of initial config data that needs to be synchronized from the Primary node. Please be patient till the process completes.": "加入集群的过程可能需要一段时间才能完成，具体取决于需要从主节点同步的初始配置数据量。请耐心等待该过程完成。",
+    "NSEC3, makes it difficult to perform \"zone walking\" since it uses hashing with a random salt. NSEC3 should be used if your zone contains any private/internal records that you do not wish to be enumerable.": "NSEC3 使得执行“区域行走”变得困难，因为它使用带有随机盐的散列。如果您的区域包含您不希望枚举的任何私人/内部记录，则应使用 NSEC3。",
+    "LDAP authentication will work only when all of the required parameters are configured correctly. If it does not work for any reason, check the Logs section on the panel and search for related error logs.": "仅当所有必需参数均正确配置时，LDAP 身份验证才会起作用。如果由于任何原因不起作用，请检查面板上的“日志”部分并搜索相关错误日志。",
+    "The failure TTL value to be used for caching failure responses. This allows storing failure record in cache and prevent frequent recursive resolution requests to the name servers that are responding with": "用于缓存失败响应的失败 TTL 值。这允许将故障记录存储在缓存中，并防止对响应的名称服务器进行频繁的递归解析请求",
+    "If no security policy is configured in the Primary Zone then access will be provided only based on the options selected here. Thus setting up a security policy in the Primary Zone is highly recommended.": "如果主区域中未配置安全策略，则仅根据此处选择的选项提供访问权限。因此，强烈建议在主要区域中设置安全策略。",
+    "Removing a DHCP lease from the server side will NOT remove the allocated IP address from the client side. Make sure that the client assigned this lease is not connected to the network before proceeding.": "从服务器端删除 DHCP 租约不会从客户端删除分配的 IP 地址。在继续之前，请确保分配此租约的客户端未连接到网络。",
+    "and Enable DNSSEC Validation option unchecked. This conditional forwarder zone will disable DNSSEC validation for the NTP server domain name and allow the device to update its system data/time on boot.": "并取消选中启用 DNSSEC 验证选项。此条件转发器区域将禁用 NTP 服务器域名的 DNSSEC 验证，并允许设备在启动时更新其系统数据/时间。",
+    "The maximum amount of time the DNS Server will wait for the response to be sent. This option will apply for DNS requests being received by the DNS Server over TCP, TLS, TcpProxy, or HTTPS transports.": "DNS 服务器等待发送响应的最长时间。此选项将适用于 DNS 服务器通过 TCP、TLS、TcpProxy 或 HTTPS 传输接收的 DNS 请求。",
+    "Enter either a hash value that you have independently generated, OR enter the certificate in PEM format to automatically generate the association data based on the Selector and Matching Type values.": "输入您独立生成的哈希值，或者输入 PEM 格式的证书，以根据选择器和匹配类型值自动生成关联数据。",
+    "The DNS Server uses Epsilon-Greedy machine learning algorithm and will automatically learn which of the forwarders are answering faster without errors and will use those forwarders most of the time.": "DNS 服务器使用 Epsilon-Greedy 机器学习算法，将自动了解哪些转发器应答速度更快且不会出现错误，并且大多数时间都会使用这些转发器。",
+    "The HTTP header that must be used to read client's actual IP address when the request comes from a reverse proxy. The specified header will be read only when the request IP address is allowed by the": "当请求来自反向代理时，必须使用 HTTP 标头来读取客户端的实际 IP 地址。仅当请求IP地址被允许时，指定的标头才会被读取。",
+    "Specify the Unix Domain Sockets (UDS) file path for DNS-over-HTTPS protocol service. Ensure that the DNS Server has read+write permissions to the parent directory to be able to create the UDS file.": "指定 DNS-over-HTTPS 协议服务的 Unix 域套接字 (UDS) 文件路径。确保 DNS 服务器对父目录具有读+写权限，以便能够创建 UDS 文件。",
+    "Enable this option to allow DHCP server to find out if an IP address is already in use to prevent IP address conflict when some of the devices on the network have manually configured IP addresses.": "启用此选项可让 DHCP 服务器查找 IP 地址是否已被使用，以防止网络上的某些设备手动配置 IP 地址时发生 IP 地址冲突。",
