+    "The IPv4 source addresses that the DNS Server must use for making all outbound DNS requests when the server is connected to two or more networks. Network addresses are also accepted.": "当服务器连接到两个或多个网络时，DNS 服务器必须使用它来发出所有出站 DNS 请求的 IPv4 源地址。网络地址也被接受。",
