+    "The minimum TTL value that a record can have in the cache. Set a value to make sure that the records with TTL value less than that stays in cache for a minimum duration.": "记录在缓存中可以拥有的最小 TTL 值。设置一个值，以确保 TTL 值小于该值的记录在缓存中保留最短时间。",
